  "label": "Peaceful declaration mapped onto the man with beard",
  "description": "The top text 'i am peaceful! don't believe me?' is an analogical mapping where the speaker (the man with beard) is projected as the entity claiming to be peaceful. The visual of the man, with his intense expression and raised finger, is juxtaposed with the text to create a contrast between his claimed peacefulness and his apparent confrontational demeanor.",
